# Pairs with NoFalseAbsence. The reconciler treats an anchor absent at the
# intent and absent again as unmoved, so a create that committed, whose caller
# then crashed before its finalize, and which a later delete removed, is
# recorded as not committed.
MODULE: AuditReconcilerAbsentIsUnmoved
TARGET: NoFalseAbsence
CLASS: Invariant
SUMMARY: an anchor absent before and after is taken as proof that nothing committed
PERTURBS: Reconcile

--- FIND
        unmoved == IF op[o].base # 0 THEN Obs = op[o].base ELSE Obs = 0 /\ viewComplete /\ Len(hist) = op[o].mark
--- REPLACE
        unmoved == Obs = op[o].base
--- END
